      "content": "hey, i need to ask u something weird. i've been noticing this pattern at work and it's kinda stressing me out. whenever i get really upset or even just really intense frustration, the lights in my cubicle flicker or my monitor will just randomly glitch out. it's happened like 4 times this week alone. has anyone ever talked about people actually projecting some kind of kinetic energy or bio-electricity through their nervous system when they're emotional? like... is that even a physical possibility?",
